>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `register_term_postprocessor`

``` hol4
Refute.register_term_postprocessor :
  hol_type -> (term -> term) -> unit
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Registers a display transformation for reported values.

`register_term_postprocessor pat f` applies `f` bottom-up to every
subterm of a reported value whose type matches `pat`.  Callbacks for
more general patterns run before more specific ones, and otherwise in
registration order; registering a pattern again replaces its callback.
A callback that raises or changes the type is skipped.  Testing and
certification use the unprocessed value.

Built-in patterns are `:'a -> 'b` (update chains), `:'a |-> 'b`
(finite-map notation), `:rat` and `:real`; registering one of them
replaces the built-in.  Registrations last for the session.

### Failure

Never fails.

### See also

[`Refute.refute`](#Refute.refute).
